# Timers

Timers are values; controls save state in the note, ticking never edits it.

focus := countdown(25m)
work := stopwatch()

- [ ] One focused session @timer(focus) @estimate(25m)
- [ ] Investigate the flaky test @timer(work)

Time left: [focus.remaining]. Running: [focus.running]. Spent: [work.elapsed].

<!-- Try: use the Start code lens or code action on a timer line. The countdown
inlay shows a live gauge. Completing a task does not stop its timer. -->
